{"id":"b59d5ff6e43660a9","group":"67","path":"67/67-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate.md","title":"Recursively Enumerable Relations","display":"df-recursively-enumerable-predicate — Recursively Enumerable Relations","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate","aliases":["67-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate"],"display":"df-recursively-enumerable-predicate — Recursively Enumerable Relations","depends_on":["[[67-df-recursive-function-class]]"],"revision_status":"locally-reconstructed","machine_verified":false,"verification_status":"local-interface-and-dependency-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revision_date":"2026-10-14"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-recursively-enumerable-predicate — Recursively Enumerable Relations"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5f966a5415552b4e\" href=\"?note=5f966a5415552b4e\" title=\"67-df-recursive-function-class\">67-df-recursive-function-class</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revision_status","html":"locally-reconstructed"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-interface-and-dependency-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\ge1\">\\(k\\ge1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartRec}_k\">\\(\\mathrm{PartRec}_k\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5f966a5415552b4e\" href=\"?note=5f966a5415552b4e\" title=\"67-df-recursive-function-class\">67-df-recursive-function-class</a> 的部分递归函数类。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RE}_k\">\\(\\mathrm{RE}_k\\)</span> 是元层谓词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{REPred}_k\">\\(\\mathrm{REPred}_k\\)</span> 是相应集合类。理论条目使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k=1\">\\(k=1\\)</span>，一致有效理论族可使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k=2\">\\(k=2\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RE}_k(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists f\\in\\mathrm{PartRec}_k\\ (A=\\operatorname{dom}(f)),\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{REPred}_k\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k:\\mathrm{RE}_k(A)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{RE}_k(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists f\\in\\mathrm{PartRec}_k\\ (A=\\operatorname{dom}(f)),\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{REPred}_k\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k:\\mathrm{RE}_k(A)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RE}_k(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists R\\in\\mathrm{PRPred}_{k+1}\\\n\\forall\\vec n\\in\\mathbb N^k\\ (\\vec n\\in A\\leftrightarrow\\exists w\\in\\mathbb N\\ ((\\vec n,w)\\in R)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{RE}_k(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists R\\in\\mathrm{PRPred}_{k+1}\\\n\\forall\\vec n\\in\\mathbb N^k\\ (\\vec n\\in A\\leftrightarrow\\exists w\\in\\mathbb N\\ ((\\vec n,w)\\in R)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条只给出后续条目实际使用的接口；所有数学条件均已列入前两节。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-recursive-function-class","status":"resolved","id":"5f966a5415552b4e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-recursive-function-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-recursive-function-class","status":"resolved","id":"5f966a5415552b4e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$k\\ge1$，$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k$；$\\mathrm{PartRec}_k$ 为 [[67-df-recursive-function-class]] 的部分递归函数类。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"k\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartRec}_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RE}_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{REPred}_k","display":false},{"tex":"k=1","display":false},{"tex":"k=2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RE}_k(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists f\\in\\mathrm{PartRec}_k\\ (A=\\operatorname{dom}(f)),\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{REPred}_k\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k:\\mathrm{RE}_k(A)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RE}_k(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists R\\in\\mathrm{PRPred}_{k+1}\\\n\\forall\\vec n\\in\\mathbb N^k\\ (\\vec n\\in A\\leftrightarrow\\exists w\\in\\mathbb N\\ ((\\vec n,w)\\in R)).","display":true}],"bytes":1345,"backlinks":[{"id":"d3b04e0df1122f31","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"cbf26fce63165619","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"74fe2bcb840f383c","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定该有限树语法的自然原始递归编码 $h:\\mathrm{Prop}\\hookrightarrow\\mathbb N$，$\\mathrm{RE}_1$ 是自然数集合的递归可枚举性，见 [[67-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate]]。$F\\subseteq\\mathrm{Prop}$，$v:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}$，$\\Phi:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}$。"},{"id":"ae4400eaf5ddc9a9","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元